§§ `53.5 and 53.6 -- the attributed amounts take the place of the amounts of sections 53.1 and 53.2`

-- src:1486 | 53.5 For each year in which there is an attribution of an amount under section 53.3, the amount of the first additional unadjusted pensionable earnings of a contributor for the year determined under section 53.1 is to be replaced by that amount and that amount is considered to be the contributor’s first additional unadjusted pensionable earnings for that year.
@ref Act s 53.5 (src:1486)
GIVEN `the first additional unadjusted pensionable earnings determined under section 53.1 for the year` IS A NUMBER
      `the amount attributed under section 53.3 for the year, if one is attributed` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
-- Plain gloss: for a year in which an amount is attributed under section 53.3, that amount replaces the amount of section
-- 53.1 and is the contributor's first additional unadjusted pensionable earnings for the year.
`s 53.5 — the first additional unadjusted pensionable earnings of a contributor for a year of attribution` `the first additional unadjusted pensionable earnings determined under section 53.1 for the year` `the amount attributed under section 53.3 for the year, if one is attributed` MEANS
    fromMaybe `the first additional unadjusted pensionable earnings determined under section 53.1 for the year` `the amount attributed under section 53.3 for the year, if one is attributed`

-- src:1488 | 53.6 For each year in which there is an attribution of an amount under section 53.4, the amount of the second additional unadjusted pensionable earnings of a contributor for the year determined under section 53.2 is to be replaced by that amount and that amount is considered to be the contributor’s second additional unadjusted pensionable earnings for that year.
@ref Act s 53.6 (src:1488)
GIVEN `the second additional unadjusted pensionable earnings determined under section 53.2 for the year` IS A NUMBER
      `the amount attributed under section 53.4 for the year, if one is attributed` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 53.6 — the second additional unadjusted pensionable earnings of a contributor for a year of attribution` `the second additional unadjusted pensionable earnings determined under section 53.2 for the year` `the amount attributed under section 53.4 for the year, if one is attributed` MEANS
    fromMaybe `the second additional unadjusted pensionable earnings determined under section 53.2 for the year` `the amount attributed under section 53.4 for the year, if one is attributed`

§§ `54, 54.1 and 54.2 -- years of division`

-- Not a provision: sections 54, 54.1 and 54.2 each say that the amount of a tier for a year of division "is to be adjusted"
-- and leave the adjustment to the division sections: where there is a division under this Act and under a provincial pension
-- plan, the contributor's total for the year is the aggregate of the amount attributed under this Act's division and the amount
-- attributed under the provincial plan (sections 55(5) and 55.2(6), (6.1)); where there is a division under this Act alone, the
-- amount attributed by it is the amount (sections 55(4) and 55.2(5), (5.1)); in a year without a division the amount of section 53 stays.
GIVEN `the amount determined for the year under sections 53 to 53.6` IS A NUMBER
      `the amount attributed to the contributor for the year by a division under this Act, if there is one` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `the amount attributed to the contributor for the year by a division under a provincial pension plan, if there is one` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`cp3 — the unadjusted pensionable earnings of a year after a division` `the amount determined for the year under sections 53 to 53.6` `the amount attributed to the contributor for the year by a division under this Act, if there is one` `the amount attributed to the contributor for the year by a division under a provincial pension plan, if there is one` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the amount attributed to the contributor for the year by a division under this Act, if there is one`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `the amount determined for the year under sections 53 to 53.6`
    WHEN JUST here THEN
        (CONSIDER `the amount attributed to the contributor for the year by a division under a provincial pension plan, if there is one`
         WHEN NOTHING THEN here
         WHEN JUST there THEN here PLUS there)

